// =============================================================================
// Chora Payments — User Mana Top-Up events (Stripe-driven)
// =============================================================================
//
// Aggregate root: UserManaTopUp (1:1 with a Stripe Checkout session for a
//                 per-learner FE-initiated mana purchase, distinct from the
//                 admin-initiated TenantManaTopUp).
// Owning domain : Payments (chora_payments DB, per ADR-164).
// Topic prefix  : chora.payments.user_mana_topup.*
//
// Closes Stage E debt: `/api/v1/me/mana/topup` (per-user FE-initiated mana
// purchase) was retired from chora-identity but did not previously map onto
// the 5 aggregates (tenant_mana_topup is ADMIN-initiated). Stage A.5
// introduces this 6th aggregate as a per-user mirror.
//
// Originating-service notification path: chora-identity subscribes to
